209035cc50392fbb2fa94f.mp4?t=1774360788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Wu Xing: Generation and Overcoming</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental system based on the cycle of creation and destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/613e89abd0e8961c316dafd9517c99f3.avif?t=1774360788\" width=616 height=616 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;<strong>CREATION OF THE GODS</strong>&quot; stands as a masterpiece of Chinese mythological literature, a widely beloved classical novel set against the Shang-Zhou dynastic war. It paints a grand celestial tapestry through Jiang Ziya's divine mission, intertwining the fates of immortals and mortal warriors. Blending profound Daoist philosophy with dazzling fantasy\u2014magical artifacts, divine formations, and mythical creatures\u2014the novel's romantic imagination endows it with timeless legendary appeal.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/ebe1e61ad10f5b7d2b0b4d9c0d93fb4c.avif?t=1774360788\" width=616 height=416 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A selection of highlights from the original novel\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter 30: INCIDENTS LEADING TO A REBELLION; Chapter 31: FLIGHT AND PURSUIT; Chapter 32: HUANG TIANHUA MEETS HIS FATHER; Chapter 33: THE BATTLE AT SISHUI PASS; Chapter 34: HUANG FEIHU MEETS THE PRIME MINISTER\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/6853d7989e665bbcb4ad1dd923d1415a.poster.avif?t=1774360788\" w